{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"eb67a8b8a5a3dafd","children":[{"parent":"7ba8f4e9b2271f62","children":[],"id":"43093f9b0290eb6e","title":"gcc -E hello.c -o hello.i<br>"},{"parent":"7ba8f4e9b2271f62","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"9ead384a41201d12","title":"-E&nbsp;相当于告诉gcc，&nbsp;只执行预处理步骤"},{"parent":"7ba8f4e9b2271f62","children":[],"id":"8e4f1da430fc6c14","title":"-o&nbsp;相当于告诉它，生成一个文件。&nbsp;不要往屏幕上做打印"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7ba8f4e9b2271f62","title":"预处理"},{"parent":"eb67a8b8a5a3dafd","children":[{"parent":"602449f92e3c3322","children":[],"id":"8af7e7777867989b","title":"gcc -S hello.i/hello.c -o hello.s"},{"parent":"602449f92e3c3322","children":[],"id":"a87e948f7cbe07ee","title":"会生成一个汇编代码，我们不需要会汇编代码。知道有这个过程"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"602449f92e3c3322","title":"编译"},{"parent":"eb67a8b8a5a3dafd","children":[{"parent":"a8077ae619bf37e0","children":[],"id":"bd612554e190cba1","title":"gcc -c hello.s -o hello.o"},{"parent":"a8077ae619bf37e0","children":[],"id":"d4c86fc746d64518","title":"会生成机器指令。&nbsp;这时候会生成二进制的数据，人很难看懂"},{"parent":"a8077ae619bf37e0","children":[{"parent":"8bfbf86ca177a9b2","children":[],"id":"5c1fd48ae0f9ed1a","title":":%!xxd"},{"parent":"8bfbf86ca177a9b2","children":[],"id":"11bfc1d77c81ff39","title":":%!xxd -r"},{"parent":"8bfbf86ca177a9b2","children":[],"id":"1f1b9ef921cd2ed3","title":"或者可以直接使用xxd&nbsp;文件名来查看<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8bfbf86ca177a9b2","title":"得到机器指令之后，其实是二进制。&nbsp;我们想看看二进制是什么东西，可以将其转换为16进制"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8077ae619bf37e0","title":"汇编"},{"parent":"eb67a8b8a5a3dafd","children":[{"parent":"f072be46622aaad7","children":[],"id":"4c098f24fa826c13","title":"gcc test1.c //&nbsp;没有指定可执行程序的名称，会生成一个 a.out的可执行程序<br>gcc test1.c -o test1<br>"},{"parent":"f072be46622aaad7","children":[],"id":"ffe4e9a4e0e749c0","title":"如果想多个文件链接到一起。&nbsp;只用将多个文件，同时放到gcc&nbsp;后面<br>gcc test2.c test222.c -o test2<br>最终，会将多个.c&nbsp;变成一个可执行程序。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f072be46622aaad7","title":"链接过程指令"},{"parent":"eb67a8b8a5a3dafd","children":[{"parent":"b38d9e22f8f50eea","children":[{"parent":"2cea350ef4ec6f03","children":[],"id":"a700dd71cbaaa17b","title":"warning"},{"parent":"2cea350ef4ec6f03","children":[],"id":"930a5d48056d1233","title":"error"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2cea350ef4ec6f03","title":"-Wall&nbsp;会打印出所有的警告信息。建议大家加上&nbsp;"},{"parent":"b38d9e22f8f50eea","children":[{"parent":"10fd05bf32ffec6b","children":[],"id":"1bc12c5bd609f3d7","title":"编译器会帮你优化你的代码"},{"parent":"10fd05bf32ffec6b","children":[],"id":"fde37a71f7de4130","title":"编译器的优化，会进行一些同义替换。&nbsp;但是在debug的时候，我们不希望它进行优化。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"10fd05bf32ffec6b","children":[],"id":"8d15cc8f8c595025","title":"-O0&nbsp;不优化，&nbsp;在debug的，会选这个。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"10fd05bf32ffec6b","title":"-O0,-O1,-O2,-O3编译器优化级别："},{"parent":"b38d9e22f8f50eea","children":[],"id":"c443bceb6e7caaf0","title":"-g：&nbsp;调试的时候使用，&nbsp;像一些变量名在编译的过程中会被丢掉，可以通过-g告诉编译器，帮我保留。我还要使用的<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b38d9e22f8f50eea","title":"其他的选项"},{"parent":"eb67a8b8a5a3dafd","children":[{"parent":"afc855200db837ef","children":[],"id":"3382ab9023d08261","title":"在有一些环境中，我们希望打印的越多越好。&nbsp;比如调试的时候。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"afc855200db837ef","children":[],"id":"e7096ddea2226863","title":"但是在最后调试完成之后，代码需要放到真实的生产环境上运行时候。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"afc855200db837ef","children":[],"id":"2842a84a1db794b7","title":"条件编译：&nbsp;就是控制，在有一些环境的时候加上。&nbsp;有一些环境的时候别加这段代码"},{"parent":"afc855200db837ef","children":[],"id":"2445051886280dae","title":"在项目要上线的前夕，应该尽量保证代码不要动。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"afc855200db837ef","children":[{"parent":"af8b88c9ce0c7b09","children":[],"id":"142a1c4b5f8601ab","title":"语法不难"},{"parent":"af8b88c9ce0c7b09","children":[],"id":"b3e24a69093fbbd1","title":"难得是干啥的<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af8b88c9ce0c7b09","title":"语法"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold"},"id":"afc855200db837ef","title":"条件编译"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"eb67a8b8a5a3dafd","title":"编译工具"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"6496f24590acac22","children":[],"id":"7abb45e3922b1c2a","title":"GDB是一个在Linux下调试的程序。&nbsp;我们可以使用GDB来调试我们的代码。<br>它里面也有类似VS中的各种调试功能，但是都是使用命令来完成的"},{"parent":"6496f24590acac22","children":[],"id":"49279682e4de2bd2","title":"安装GDB"},{"parent":"6496f24590acac22","children":[{"parent":"29902d38f771d0d4","children":[],"id":"f9832238db4e806c","title":"gcc hello.c -o hello -g -O0 -Wall<br>"},{"parent":"29902d38f771d0d4","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"ee1ab58b14a82d34","title":"-g&nbsp; -Wall -O0&nbsp;的含义要知道"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"29902d38f771d0d4","title":"生成带调试信息的可执行程序指令"},{"parent":"6496f24590acac22","children":[{"parent":"01bf7147f52fde73","children":[],"id":"679b24f0fde315de","title":"方式1： gdb&nbsp; 文件名"},{"parent":"01bf7147f52fde73","children":[],"id":"4a8d8d9c601c95a5","title":"方式2：&nbsp;<br>gdb&nbsp;<br>file test1"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"01bf7147f52fde73","title":"进入GDB"},{"parent":"6496f24590acac22","children":[{"parent":"ca6b6ea59f64a6d1","children":[{"parent":"5c477f0bdf57dba9","children":[],"id":"e3fad3ac61bbbd31","title":"显示代码。&nbsp;看一下打断点的位置"},{"parent":"5c477f0bdf57dba9","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8587b3884d18590d","title":"l&nbsp;就是查看源代码，默认就是往下翻"},{"parent":"5c477f0bdf57dba9","children":[],"id":"332c438971cc7ab8","title":"l -&nbsp;就是上翻"},{"parent":"5c477f0bdf57dba9","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"0555f620a5920b92","title":"l&nbsp;行号"},{"parent":"5c477f0bdf57dba9","children":[],"id":"34a8a84717ee0f4f","title":"l&nbsp;文件名:行号：&nbsp;在多个.c生成的可执行程序中，可以使用这个固定看哪个文件的多少行"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"5c477f0bdf57dba9","title":"list/l"},{"parent":"ca6b6ea59f64a6d1","children":[{"parent":"b189d0643ebccc36","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"fb140725c34c275a","title":"run/r :&nbsp;启动程序。&nbsp;这里就是以debug模式启动"},{"parent":"b189d0643ebccc36","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c2550472b5de3d29","title":"kill/k :&nbsp;终止调试。但是不会退出GDB"},{"parent":"b189d0643ebccc36","children":[],"id":"4a3344cd295c9fac","title":"quit/q:&nbsp;退出gdb。&nbsp;这时候调试肯定也退了"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b189d0643ebccc36","title":"一些散命令"},{"parent":"ca6b6ea59f64a6d1","children":[{"parent":"26adbf5804f1743e","children":[{"parent":"156849ace1aa5efa","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"317e039c6bf74e5f","title":"b&nbsp;行号"},{"parent":"156849ace1aa5efa","children":[],"id":"8a9296d754d607f3","title":"b&nbsp;文件名:行号"},{"parent":"156849ace1aa5efa","children":[],"id":"f8bd3004564905d6","title":"tb&nbsp;临时断点。&nbsp;这个断点只会有效一次，后续就会被直接删掉"},{"parent":"156849ace1aa5efa","children":[],"id":"90ad498094fbf98d","title":"break&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold"},"id":"156849ace1aa5efa","title":"打断点"},{"parent":"26adbf5804f1743e","children":[{"parent":"81f06ab7cefa70ef","children":[],"id":"3d28d27b61a7a2e9","title":"info break/ i b"},{"parent":"81f06ab7cefa70ef","children":[{"parent":"5e5ef38e6eabed23","children":[],"id":"64d28a75b398482d","title":"Num:&nbsp;是一个唯一值。&nbsp;会不断自增，即使你将断点删除，再建一个断点，也不会二次利用这个序号<br>所以，它是唯一的"},{"parent":"5e5ef38e6eabed23","children":[{"parent":"cb1ad20526008a0f","children":[{"parent":"85115ef817d14eab","children":[],"id":"e84172400194f34a","title":"一次性断点。程序运行过一次断点之后。断点就会被删掉"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"85115ef817d14eab","title":"keep表示是持久断点<br>del表示是一次性断点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb1ad20526008a0f","title":"disp"},{"parent":"5e5ef38e6eabed23","children":[{"parent":"188cc43c36066a45","children":[],"id":"e204de158ebeddac","title":"断点是否生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"188cc43c36066a45","title":"enb"},{"parent":"5e5ef38e6eabed23","children":[{"parent":"c1faf2951ac7b61d","children":[],"id":"c555241986ee5a8c","title":"断点在哪个位置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c1faf2951ac7b61d","title":"what"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e5ef38e6eabed23","title":"展示的信息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"81f06ab7cefa70ef","title":"查看断点"},{"parent":"26adbf5804f1743e","children":[{"parent":"98cf9f645afb6707","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"76c4f953bc517cd6","title":"d [Num]：&nbsp;输入的Num就是在info break的时候看到的"},{"parent":"98cf9f645afb6707","children":[],"id":"3c8be2f2c9f16dec","title":"d&nbsp; &nbsp;断点全删掉"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"98cf9f645afb6707","title":"删除断点"},{"parent":"26adbf5804f1743e","children":[{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[{"parent":"3443fbf0f7f4ce50","children":[],"id":"bcd02b0e08ff7c19","title":"什么函数都会往里面进"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"3443fbf0f7f4ce50","title":"step/s&nbsp; ：&nbsp;一步步执行，碰到函数会进入"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[{"parent":"9ff4e0fa463d8298","children":[],"id":"d2a1730b4d0b86d3","title":"系统函数，建议用n。&nbsp;比如像printf，如果使用s。进不去"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"9ff4e0fa463d8298","title":"next/n:&nbsp;一步步执行，碰到函数不会进入<br>"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"6c991d8f75caf152","title":"c:&nbsp;跳到下一次断点。&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[],"id":"e7268e6ba5039dff","title":"finish/fin :&nbsp;跳出函数，比如函数的执行过程比较复杂，现在想让函数直接结束。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[{"parent":"8b6ffc1ea3ba915e","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"b4a4ea97f75f00e7","title":"print一般用来做输出。&nbsp;也用的比较多"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8b6ffc1ea3ba915e","title":"print/p express：&nbsp;打印某个表达式的值。&nbsp;<br>其实还可以使用这个来改变量的值。&nbsp;<br>print num=10&nbsp; 相当于在程序运行时来修改变量的值<br>"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[{"parent":"db8681f666530db3","children":[],"id":"15baddd5d7ca4f47","title":"display：&nbsp;也要注意一下。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db8681f666530db3","title":"display/disp :&nbsp;将一个表达式的值持续挂在输出上。&nbsp;<br>undisplay/undisp :&nbsp;取消持续的输出，注意这里的参数是编号<br>info disp:&nbsp;查看有哪些持续的输出。&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[],"id":"96698a9a349cefad","title":"info args:&nbsp;输出参数<br>info locals:&nbsp;输出局部变量"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold"},"id":"009bd2c5e6987cb8","title":"ignore N count :&nbsp;跳过N号断点，count次。这个在循环的时候比较有用"},{"parent":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","children":[],"id":"f610a567c0475f73","title":"查看内存"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8c2dd3cf768affe0","title":"运行"},{"parent":"26adbf5804f1743e","children":[{"parent":"196292acd15dbdb8","children":[],"id":"7327e4c3c375cd9e","title":"bt:&nbsp;显示函数调用栈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"196292acd15dbdb8","title":"其他的信息"},{"parent":"26adbf5804f1743e","children":[{"parent":"67c0dd47d5cd8ad7","children":[],"id":"3131e2c4d3f6d7c2","title":"./test1 111 222 333&nbsp;"},{"parent":"67c0dd47d5cd8ad7","children":[],"id":"5cb902e7000338a5","title":"在GDB运行的时候，如何传参。&nbsp;<br>r&nbsp;参数1&nbsp; 参数2&nbsp; 参数3&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"67c0dd47d5cd8ad7","title":"在平常的时候，可能需要传参"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"26adbf5804f1743e","title":"断点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca6b6ea59f64a6d1","title":"正式的操作"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"6496f24590acac22","title":"GDB调试"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"008f88e71a171105","children":[{"parent":"4b19996178746678","children":[],"id":"c450e69bae0071e6","title":"简单说，就是别人写好的轮子，我拿过来直接使用。"},{"parent":"4b19996178746678","children":[],"id":"aec67444d818e64d","title":"库文件的分类：&nbsp;静态库和动态库"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"4b19996178746678","title":"什么是库文件"},{"parent":"008f88e71a171105","children":[{"parent":"76472e19d5aca427","children":[],"id":"505802140606cbb4","title":"静态库就是在链接阶段就将程序的代码，整个整过去的库。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"76472e19d5aca427","children":[],"id":"6892155ab5fb9a80","title":"动态库就是只存待会去哪找。在链接阶段不会把别人的代码弄过来"},{"parent":"76472e19d5aca427","children":[{"parent":"936b170cecaa7565","children":[{"parent":"f4b66ba296ed9988","children":[{"parent":"05a24f843e9ca425","children":[],"id":"1c4c95aa3d359446","title":"快"},{"parent":"05a24f843e9ca425","children":[],"id":"7df715dfa87cbf7c","title":"移植性强"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"05a24f843e9ca425","title":"优点"},{"parent":"f4b66ba296ed9988","children":[{"parent":"12191276d1364fe6","children":[],"id":"0fc876b32ad2479e","title":"生成的可执行程序大。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"12191276d1364fe6","children":[],"id":"4382cbfbcfbf73c9","title":"如果库进行了升级，所有依赖这个库的都需要重新链接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"12191276d1364fe6","title":"缺点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4b66ba296ed9988","title":"静态库"},{"parent":"936b170cecaa7565","children":[{"parent":"fb0b07f00a0dd9da","children":[{"parent":"a4573b418eae9fe7","children":[],"id":"552b9790cc3de4a4","title":"小。"},{"parent":"a4573b418eae9fe7","children":[],"id":"0bee5940d8180f9f","title":"对于开发者和使用者友好。&nbsp;升级了之后，使用者不需要重新进行链接。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4573b418eae9fe7","title":"优点"},{"parent":"fb0b07f00a0dd9da","children":[{"parent":"7161b7e53beb6ff7","children":[],"id":"a181c4ef1c1156a0","title":"移植性不好。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"7161b7e53beb6ff7","children":[],"id":"c9aeb9bdae261896","title":"速度会稍微慢一点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7161b7e53beb6ff7","title":"缺点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb0b07f00a0dd9da","title":"动态库"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"936b170cecaa7565","title":"优缺点"},{"parent":"76472e19d5aca427","children":[{"parent":"6d4ab136be60f8d3","children":[],"id":"7e03a760114b4369","title":"一般根据移植性、体积来选"},{"parent":"6d4ab136be60f8d3","children":[],"id":"ee9462bf6e82e05a","title":"要知道怎么选，但是一般自己选的概率不大"}],"id":"6d4ab136be60f8d3","title":"得知道根据优缺点，怎么去选动态库和静态库"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"76472e19d5aca427","title":"什么是静态库，什么是动态库"},{"parent":"008f88e71a171105","children":[{"parent":"81f1b775bab28523","children":[],"id":"98e95d88decbc7ba","title":"看一看、练一练"},{"parent":"81f1b775bab28523","children":[],"id":"f00c10eb16c38cc0","title":"下次碰到了查文档"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"81f1b775bab28523","title":"生成静态库和动态库的指令"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"008f88e71a171105","title":"库文件"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"9aa956f4803fba2c","children":[{"parent":"8a0c074c77f56165","children":[],"id":"6c44d2a388f56cc4","title":"就是一个脚本，我们用来生成可执行程序的命令，可以放在这个脚本里。这样我们就不用每次都去写这个生成的命令。&nbsp;<br>然后我们又想用这个命令。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"8a0c074c77f56165","children":[],"id":"7a3d8c273d1c5154","title":"脚本就是文本。&nbsp;这个文本可以直接运行"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8a0c074c77f56165","title":"需要知道什么是Makefile"},{"parent":"9aa956f4803fba2c","children":[{"parent":"21ddee267f53e9b3","children":[],"id":"af161d6333413b62","title":"基本语法得知道"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21ddee267f53e9b3","title":"Makefile的基本组成单元得知道"},{"parent":"9aa956f4803fba2c","children":[{"parent":"805c198e12a27222","children":[],"id":"4f33e0dc324c9b5f","title":"代码如果经过了更改。&nbsp;它会重新执行编译这个步骤，最终生成main.o."}],"collapsed":true,"id":"805c198e12a27222","title":"增量编译得知道"},{"parent":"9aa956f4803fba2c","children":[{"parent":"1a3d2e5b655e065a","children":[],"id":"80c4861acf635481","title":"我给一个Makefile。&nbsp;你要知道怎么使用"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"1a3d2e5b655e065a","title":"使用得知道"},{"parent":"9aa956f4803fba2c","children":[{"parent":"7e14bca85ecb72c7","children":[],"id":"d4ac81ab2d0c5c3c","title":"后续一般是这样的，我们写一个test1.c文件<br>gcc test1.c -o test1 -Wall -g&nbsp;"},{"parent":"7e14bca85ecb72c7","children":[],"id":"ad2ebfcf333d4a40","title":"所以，我们给大家提供了一个通用的Makefile。&nbsp;检查你这里面有哪些.c文件。&nbsp;<br>然后将这些.c生成同名的&nbsp;可执行程序。&nbsp;<br>只要这些文件做了修改。&nbsp;就增量编译<br>"},{"parent":"7e14bca85ecb72c7","children":[],"id":"b874c028ec81ee70","title":"通配符"},{"parent":"7e14bca85ecb72c7","children":[],"id":"caea3f5b0136c339","title":"test1.c---&gt; test1<br>test2.c --&gt; test2"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e14bca85ecb72c7","title":"后续，我们的使用场景基本是怎样的？"},{"parent":"9aa956f4803fba2c","children":[{"parent":"99f1c43eb8404842","children":[],"id":"60ca409a6e00f67b","title":"创建一个Makefile。然后将我们写好的东西放进去。&nbsp;它就可以帮你完成编译、链接的功能<br>同时也可以删除，或者重新编译链接这些文件"},{"parent":"99f1c43eb8404842","children":[],"id":"30bb1156d14a30ee","title":"make"},{"parent":"99f1c43eb8404842","children":[],"id":"fcc325d8ba9440b7","title":"make&nbsp;clean"},{"parent":"99f1c43eb8404842","children":[{"parent":"afde30fcb8c294f6","children":[],"id":"4dd06557b3c7732a","title":"先把之前生成的文件，全干掉"},{"parent":"afde30fcb8c294f6","children":[],"id":"4fb547e8166203b7","title":"然后再重新生成一遍"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afde30fcb8c294f6","title":"make rebuild"},{"parent":"99f1c43eb8404842","children":[],"id":"fab5e392b3e4829e","title":"make buildagain<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-size":"18px"},"id":"99f1c43eb8404842","title":"Makefile的使用"},{"parent":"9aa956f4803fba2c","children":[],"id":"ae2ea9ed55f03865","title":"工作过程中，一般写Makefile的机会不多。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"9aa956f4803fba2c","title":"Makefile"}],"root":true,"theme":"theme_wps_def","showWatermark":false,"id":"root","title":"GNU编译工具集","version":658,"structure":"mind_free"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:33:58","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}